# Release archives, built per platform and uploaded to a GitHub release.
#
# Not in git: they are 84MB each, and a binary committed once stays in the history
# for good. The published ones are on the v1.0.0 release; the two macOS
# single-architecture archives are not, and exist only here — which is why these
# are ignored rather than deleted.
/dist_release/
/release_assets/
